{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1501228-bee-cult","id":1501228,"title":"Bee Cult","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-01-24T04:18:21-08:00","id":1501228,"title":"Bee Cult","content":"There was an interesting 1e bit about some Bees developing sentience (at least in their Anima Mundi dreams, not sure how it translates to the material) by drinking from the Wellspring, until their colony collapsed after the Queen Bee dissapeared.<br /> <br /> She was trying to awaken, allegedly, and the Bees still dance their spells ..<br /> <br /> Anyway, my headcannon has it that she Awakened and Ascended.<br /> <br /> And so i am thinking of writing a Bee Keeper (Mystery) Cult which worships Queen Bee.<br /> <br /> What benefits should Cult membership grant?<br /> <br /> Professional training (bee keeping), allied/contacts in the bee-keepin world?<br /> <br /> And what would the best thing to represent occult summoning knowledge that the highest ranked members of the Cult teach (attempting to summon Queen Bee herself, supernal summoning rituals... Probably not actually going to work, though even getting her attention would be great... If she exists and cares about human bee keeping...)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27248-orathaic","name":"orathaic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27248_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1032"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-24T05:35:12-08:00","id":1501232,"title":"","content":"Would it be \u2018just\u2019 a Mystery Cult, or a full-blown Nameless Order? You gotta think of Order Rote Skills too for the latter \u2014 something like Politics, Survival, and Animal Ken perhaps.<br /> <br /> Anyways, Awakened cultists could access a modified Targeted Summoning (the Attainment) that allows any cultist to summon a \u2018Bee Princess\u2019 of sorts, regardless of Path.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-24T14:55:15-08:00","id":1501268,"title":"","content":"I think a nameless order is extreme, but also awesome. Hadn't even thought of a fleshed out cabal themed around the Colony... Hmm.<br /> <br /> Summoning Bee entities based on your own path could be interesting, and inter oath disagreement a about the actual philosophical underpinning of Queen Bee's symbology as interpreted by that path.<br /> <br /> Thanks you C Hermit","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27248-orathaic","name":"orathaic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27248_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1032"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-24T15:34:02-08:00","id":1501273,"title":"","content":"I would probably use Agartha and The Buzzing from <i>The Secret World</i> as an inspiration for the lore. Regarding a Mystery Cult, here is a first draft for a hive themed cult:<br /> <br /> <b>\u2022</b>\u200b Gain the <i>Broad Dedication</i> merit related to bees<br /> <b>\u2022</b>\u200b<b>\u2022</b>\u200b Gain <i>Investigative Aide</i>, somehow there is always a member of the Hive pointing you towards the next Occult revelation<br /> <b>\u2022</b>\u200b<b>\u2022</b>\u200b<b>\u2022</b>\u200b Gain the <i>Profligate Dedication</i> merit for a tool associated with bees<br /> <b>\u2022</b>\u200b<b>\u2022</b>\u200b<b>\u2022</b>\u200b<b>\u2022</b>\u200b The Hive is always with you, whispering secrets to your mind, gain 3 dots in the <i>Library </i>merit, with an Occult focus, which can be accessed anywhere<br /> <b>\u2022</b>\u200b<b>\u2022</b>\u200b<b>\u2022</b>\u200b<b>\u2022</b>\u200b<b>\u2022</b>\u200b The buzz of the Bees grants you a position of note amongst mundane hives, gain 3 dots of the <i>Status </i>merit in an organization of your choice. Once per chapter, you can swap these dots for 3 Status in any other mundane organization of your choice.\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 01-24-2023, 06:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-25T15:20:32-08:00","id":1501350,"title":"","content":"What about the sleeper members of the Cult? Will have to ask my friends who plays secret world about that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27248-orathaic","name":"orathaic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27248_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1032"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-25T17:34:55-08:00","id":1501359,"title":"","content":"You could set requirements for attaining certain levels (i.e. only Mages can progress beyond the second dot), or have a separate track for Sleepers (i.e. they get alternative bonuses at the third dot, or they have a completely different set of bonuses)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hu